{
  "mcp_servers": [
    {
      "id": "official-filesystem-workspace",
      "name": "MCP Filesystem（官方 @modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem，需 Node/npx）",
      "command": "npx",
      "args": [
        "-y",
        "@modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem",
        "__JACHIN_WORKSPACE__"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "tavily-search",
      "name": "Tavily Search（联网检索，官方 MCP）",
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "tavily-mcp@latest"],
      "env": {
        "TAVILY_API_KEY": "${TAVILY_API_KEY}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "com.jachin.mcp.office_powerpoint",
      "name": "Jachin Office PowerPoint MCP（PPTX，可选）",
      "command": "python",
      "args": ["-m", "ppt_mcp_server"],
      "env": {
        "PPT_TEMPLATE_PATH": "__JACHIN_WORKSPACE__/ppt_templates"
      }
    }
  ],
  "_comment": "复制到 ~/.jachin/mcp_servers.json 并与仓库 tools/mcp-official/mcp_servers.jachin.example.json 按需合并。Filesystem 项：__JACHIN_WORKSPACE__ 展开为 ~/.jachin/workspace（启动时确保存在）；可追加多个绝对路径作为额外允许根目录。${TAVILY_API_KEY} 在 L3 拉起 MCP 时从进程环境展开（见 .env / 系统环境变量）。Windows 下 npx 由 MCP 宿主解析为 npx.cmd。PowerPoint 项需先 pip install office-powerpoint-mcp-server；若已用 skills_repo/plugin 下同名 L3_LOCAL 包自动注册，请勿重复相同 id。"
}
